{"4182480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smash Hit Museum", "steam_appid": 4182480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You wanna Smash?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock auto-hits, new hammers, size, speed and damage upgrades, no stone will be left unsmashed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/e50f4203009535315f0aad056d7a5b55.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/e50f4203009535315f0aad056d7a5b55.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/e50f4203009535315f0aad056d7a5b55.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The prestige that comes with the Museum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Museum Tickets in the stones and spend them on the 50+ prestige skills to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/4fb3bf3ce5c08a065aa6088b5eaf43cd.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/4fb3bf3ce5c08a065aa6088b5eaf43cd.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/4fb3bf3ce5c08a065aa6088b5eaf43cd.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fill the Museum With Visitors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors never stop coming. As your collection grows, crowds fight their way into your museum just to pay you the hefty entrance fee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/569285a92579bf031a0645e5bbd9eeb3.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/569285a92579bf031a0645e5bbd9eeb3.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/569285a92579bf031a0645e5bbd9eeb3.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History can wait, profit won't.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stone hides history and profit, don’t let it rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/c279268ae46fae14b6601b6576c4275f.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/c279268ae46fae14b6601b6576c4275f.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/c279268ae46fae14b6601b6576c4275f.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D stone-smashing clicker / idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 stones and their artifact groups, each from different eras and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 unique artifacts to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your hammer and museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip the Lucky Coin with every hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Prestige skills with Museum Tickets, to get your auto hammer going</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and soothing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You wanna Smash?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock auto-hits, new hammers, size, speed and damage upgrades, no stone will be left unsmashed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/e50f4203009535315f0aad056d7a5b55.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/e50f4203009535315f0aad056d7a5b55.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/e50f4203009535315f0aad056d7a5b55.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The prestige that comes with the Museum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Museum Tickets in the stones and spend them on the 50+ prestige skills to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/4fb3bf3ce5c08a065aa6088b5eaf43cd.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/4fb3bf3ce5c08a065aa6088b5eaf43cd.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/4fb3bf3ce5c08a065aa6088b5eaf43cd.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fill the Museum With Visitors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors never stop coming. As your collection grows, crowds fight their way into your museum just to pay you the hefty entrance fee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/569285a92579bf031a0645e5bbd9eeb3.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/569285a92579bf031a0645e5bbd9eeb3.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/569285a92579bf031a0645e5bbd9eeb3.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>History can wait, profit won't.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stone hides history and profit, don’t let it rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/c279268ae46fae14b6601b6576c4275f.poster.avif?t=1781004712\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/c279268ae46fae14b6601b6576c4275f.webm?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182480/extras/c279268ae46fae14b6601b6576c4275f.mp4?t=1781004712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D stone-smashing clicker / idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 stones and their artifact groups, each from different eras and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p